  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">III Loan for Investment Financing, Restructuring, Exporting Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">III Prstamo para Financiamiento Inversin, Reconversin, Desarrollo Exportador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es continuar apoyando los esfuerzos del gobierno, a travs de Bancldex, por fortalecer la competitividad del sector productivo mediante la financiacin de proyectos de inversin, reconversin productiva y desarrollo empresarial y exportador.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to continue supporting Colombian Government efforts to strengthen the competitiveness of productive sector by financing investment projects, production restructuring and enterprise and export development, through Bancldex.</narrative>
  </description>
